  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel names sword path as a cultivation path with Immortal Gu, killer moves, and combat systems built around extreme offense.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan activates immemorial sword dragon, all of his dao marks transform into sword path dao marks, and the narration states that everyone knew sword path’s superiority lay in offense. That form is presented as his strongest attacking shape in that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1943
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From Duke Long’s view, Fang Yuan has two mature combat systems: time path and sword path. The sword path system includes immemorial sword dragon transformation, triple layered sword wave, golden thread sword, dark assassination, myriad thought sword waterfall, swordsman, and other methods. Its trump card is five finger fist heart sword, modified by Fang Yuan. That system takes offense to the extreme and is even more powerful than time path style in pure offense, but it lacks comparable strength in movement, healing, and other fields, so those shortcomings become weaknesses against an opponent like Duke Long.",
      "chapters": [
        1946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mature-combat-system",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Demon Immortal Qi Jue’s account of Fang Yuan’s holdings names Bo Qing’s sword path true inheritance among the many true inheritances Fang Yuan possesses.",
      "chapters": [
        2054
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bo-qing-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "inh_bo_qing_sword_path_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s most mature combat systems are sword path and time path, which he used during the fate war.",
      "chapters": [
        2119
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-war-maturity-and-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After exhausting dream realms, his listed attainments include sword path at grandmaster.",
